Packaging sources for linux-cachyos-dpt
=======================================

The packaging sources in this repository (PKGBUILD, .SRCINFO, config) are a
derivative work of the linux-cachyos packaging from

    https://github.com/CachyOS/linux-cachyos

which is licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 3. Those
sources remain copyright of their respective authors — Peter Jung, Piotr
Gorski, Vasiliy Stelmachenok and the other contributors credited at the top of
the PKGBUILD — and this fork is distributed under the same terms.

    SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only

The full licence text is available at https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html
and is shipped upstream as LICENSE.md.

Modifications in this fork (the package rename, the added patch and its
checksum, the maintainer header and description) are likewise GPL-3.0-only.

Kernel and patch
----------------

The Linux kernel itself is licensed GPL-2.0-only.

0001-drm-xe-Fix-DPT-allocation-paths.patch is a backport of upstream commit
a196406a3831291598fe8e73245914f7acffdfe0 by Maarten Lankhorst
<dev@lankhorst.se>, GPL-2.0-only. It is functionally identical to that commit;
the sole difference is that __xe_pin_fb_vma_dpt() in the 7.1.x series takes a
plain `unsigned int alignment` argument rather than `pin_params->alignment`,
so the backport uses the former.
